_SCL_MastiffPoachers_LetterFromEmployer\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">852ee9d1-c9b8-4ddd-9e95-ac07a6e94b95</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:852ee9d1-c9b8-4ddd-9e95-ac07a6e94b95\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:852ee9d1-c9b8-4ddd-9e95-ac07a6e94b95\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Pilgrim\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Pilgrim\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Pilgrim_%28Portal%29_1.png/25px-Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Pilgrim_%28Portal%29_1.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Pilgrim_%28Portal%29_1.png/38px-Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Pilgrim_%28Portal%29_1.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Pilgrim_%28Portal%29_1.png/50px-Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Pilgrim_%28Portal%29_1.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow-Cursed Pilgrim\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Pilgrim_%28Portal%29_1.png/25px-Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Pilgrim_%28Portal%29_1.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Pilgrim_%28Portal%29_1.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Pilgrim\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Pilgrim\">Shadow-Cursed Pilgrim</a> who is summoned while the party defend the <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Crossing\" title=\"Shadow Crossing\">Shadow Crossing</a> during <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lift_the_Shadow_Curse\" title=\"Lift the Shadow Curse\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lift the Shadow Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Lift_the_Shadow_Curse\" title=\"Lift the Shadow Curse\">Lift the Shadow Curse</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>I need the Shadow Mastiff alive and intact - if that is not the case, the second half of your payment shall be forfeit upon your return to Baldur's Gate. I have generously paid a large amount of gold in advance, and have supplied all the necessaries you shall require to see this endeavour done correctly. They say you are unmatched as a poacher - for your sake, I hope that is no exaggeration.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715073309\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1646/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27888/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7547/419